<title>SPAIN: SOCCER-SCORERS IN THE SPANISH FIRST DIVISION.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-SCORERS IN THE SPANISH FIRST DIVISION.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-02-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading goalscorers in the Spanish first division after Sunday's games:</p>
<p>19 - Ronaldo (Barcelona)</p>
<p>16 - Davor Suker (Real Madrid)</p>
<p>13 - Jose Ziganda (Athletic Bilbao)</p>
<p>12 - Oli Alvarez (Oviedo)</p>
<p>11 - Julen Guerrero (Athletic Bilbao), Luis Enrique Martinez</p>
<p>(Barcleona)</p>
<p>10 - Raul Gonzalez (Real Madrid)</p>
<p>9 - Predrag Mijatovic (Real Madrid), Juan Eduardo Esnaider</p>
<p>(Atletico Madrid), Christopher Ohen (Compostela), Alfonso</p>
<p>Perez (Real Betis), Victor Fernandez (Valladolid)</p>
